bench/prompt.txt is llama.cpp source code, used unchanged as a fixed benchmark prompt:
src/llama-adapter.cpp, llama-arch.cpp, llama-batch.cpp, llama-chat.cpp and llama-context.cpp
at commit 1839b7817 of Backburner's llama.cpp fork (https://github.com/StayLameBro/backburner-llama.cpp,
from https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), joined by bench/make-prompt.py. It is under llama.cpp's license:

